  "contentHtml": "<p>영상을 시청하고,&#160;</p><p>영상을 요약정리하고,</p><p>영상에 대한 나의 과학적인 생각을 정리해서 제출하기</p><p>&#160;</p><p>예를 들어</p><p>다음의 영상을 시청하고</p><p>수업시간에 배운 세포호흡의 관점에서</p><p>감상문 제출하기</p><p><a href=\"https://youtu.be/hbgv7Kp5paU?si=HwOr1gnJ8wH2Cnbq\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ke-link\">https://youtu.be/hbgv7Kp5paU?si=HwOr1gnJ8wH2Cnbq</a></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=hbgv7Kp5paU\" data-video-host=\"youtube\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"480\" data-video-height=\"360\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/d6DrI6/hyYxEYVGic/vQx5KPYt8f7mBEzvnnYZ8k/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=135_84_193_147,https://scrap.kakaocdn.net/dn/bruWrK/hyYyVltGOE/XWn60yP9WkUnQpSXI8NDD1/img.jpg?width=480&amp;height=360&amp;face=135_84_193_147\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthContent\" data-video-origin-width=\"480\" data-video-origin-height=\"360\"><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/hbgv7Kp5paU\" width=\"480\" height=\"360\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
